      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "…Who is that?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/2.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "How do you not know our Goddess and Idol Jiafei? She is suppperrr famous.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/3.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "My name is Jiafei, and I am the queen of Floptropica.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/combat/voices/jiafei/ability.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "And what does she do… exactly? I’ve never heard of her.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/4.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "Sells magic egg spinners and screams.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/5.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "…",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/6.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "What kind of idol is that? She does the most idiotic shit while I sing like a goddess and have no fans?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/7.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "There’s no way that’s true. How popular is she?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/7.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "OH you BETTER shut it, don’t insult our queen like that. She has 2.1M followers on TikTok.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/8.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "….",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/9.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "WHAT THE FUCK??",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/10.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "YOU’RE TELLING ME SHE HAS OVER 2 MILLION FANS WHO ARE ALL OBSESSED WITH HER STUPID ASS DELUSIONAL ISLAND AND HER DUMBASS SCREAMS?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/11.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "How can people even like that?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/12.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "Oh you’re done for.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch1/13.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "Hmph, I’ll show you the magic of my products.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/combat/voices/jiafei/ability.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "Get on stage, and scream, until your last magical egg spinner!",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/combat/voices/jiafei/ability.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
